{"sourceUrl":"https://dwkx.jlu.edu.cn/info/1072/8450.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.113646+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dwkx.jlu.edu.cn/info/1072/8450.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p>   <span>为加深全国优秀大学生对吉林大学动物科学学院的了解，促进国内高校同专业优秀本科生之间的交流，进一步提高我院研究生招生宣传效果，特举办此次校园学术活动开放日。</span><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.申请人应为动物科学、动物医学、生物技术、生物科学、生物工程等相关专业，综合素质突出，学习成绩优秀，有一定的科研潜力。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.具有所在学校推免生资格或学业成绩优秀的202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.英语水平良好，全国大学英语四级考试成绩在425分以上。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.《开放日报名表》，报名系统中填报，成绩截止至前5个学期。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.成绩单及排名证明扫描件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>加盖公章）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.其他证明材料（已发表学术论文；参加科研项目材料；各类获奖证书；大创项目结题证书；英语四六级、托福、雅思和GRE成绩单；社会活动相关证明等）。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请方式</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>从即日起至</span></span><strong><span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>25</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>接收申请人报名，逾期不予补报。报名程序如下：</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.申请人登录吉林大学报名系统，网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yzbbm.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span>，所有内容须如实填写。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.网上提交以上申请材料的清晰彩色扫描件或照片的PDF版，打包成一个压缩文件（压缩包和邮件主题命名格式：姓名-学校-开放日），发送至指定邮箱：</span></span><span><span>huangyw</span></span><span><span>@jlu.edu.cn。所有申请者本人实名加入QQ群：832989089（验证信息：姓名-所在学校），方便及时沟通和获取后续信息。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.学院将于6月28日前在学院官网公布校园学术活动开放日学生名单。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、举办地点、时间、内容</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：吉林大学动物科学学院（吉林省长春市绿园区新竹路</span><span>1977号）</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>3日-5日</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>内容：</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）学生报到</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）学术活动</span></span><span><span>及实验室参观</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）</span></span><span><span>师生</span></span><span><span>见面会</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）学生考核</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、其他</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. 本次校园学术开放日活动活动未尽事宜或变更，请及时关注吉林大学动物科学学院官方网站或QQ群公布。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>2. 学院专家组根据申请者提供材料进行资格审查，确定参加开放日学生名单及时在学院网站公布。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>3. 学院对学生进行学术能力考核，考核合格学生名单在学院网站公布。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. 我院开放日活动不收取任何费用。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日活动期间，我院为所有学生购买人身意外伤害保险。学院为外地学生提供免费食宿，长春市本地学生不安排住宿，提供餐食和其他物品。学生路费自理，如录取为我院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>“推免生”，或参加202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年全国硕士研究生统一招生考试，录取我院的考生，可按硬卧或高铁</span><span>2等车厢及以下标准凭据实额报销学生高校（或家庭）所在地到长春往返路费，请务必保留好火车票或航空运输电子客票行程单原件。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.本通知及未尽事宜由吉林大学动物科学学院负责解释。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>. 为保证校园学术活动开放日活动的质量，我们对学生人数有限制，但仍欢迎未被录取的同学继续报考吉林大学</span></span><span><span>动物</span></span><span><span>科学学院。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人</span><span>: </span></span><span><span>黄</span></span><span><span>老师</span><span> </span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0431-87836570</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子信箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:huangyw@jlu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>huangyw@jlu.edu.cn</span></span></span></a><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院介绍和导师队伍介绍详见吉林大学动物科学学院官网：</span></span><a href=\"http://dwkx.jlu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://dwkx.jlu.edu.cn/</span></span></a><span><span>。</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>  </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>    吉林大学动物科学学院</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>      202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>6月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>  \r\n  </span></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"3036f98abeffedaefa74fed06b19aee539be11f719ef071b716579ae76a8859d","textLength":1243,"sourceSha256":"57f932d19a0c45f4dd7b94d1aa84e38287a3158c8f98a680e877e50303c9fa2f","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ff2cda2e1d041c80b3a2","title":"2026年吉林大学动物科学学院2026年校园学术活动开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:13.113646+00:00"}
